                        <br /><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:8.5pt;">(Fees paid directly from your investment)</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:1pt;line-height:1pt;">&#x2003;</font></div>
                  </div>

